@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 存档 / 读档时序

actor 玩家 as P
participant "CustomMenu" as CM
participant "SaveManager" as SM
participant "GameManager" as GM
participant "ObjectMapper\n(Jackson)" as JM
participant "文件 saves/<slot>.json" as F

== 保存 ==
P -> CM : 点击「💾 保存」
CM -> SM : save(model, slotName)
SM -> GM : getDay / getPopulation / getBuildings.size / getTechTree
SM -> SM : 组装 SaveData\n（day/resources/population/buildingCount/\nresearchedTechs/unlockedRecipes）
SM -> JM : writerWithDefaultPrettyPrinter().writeValue
JM -> F : 写入 JSON
note right of F
  已知局限：SaveData 只存 buildingCount，
  不保存建筑种类与地图坐标，
  读档后建筑布局无法还原
end note

== 读档 ==
P -> CM : 点击「📂 加载」选择存档
CM -> SM : load(model, slotName)
JM -> SM : readValue(SaveData.class)
SM -> GM : setDay / setResourceAmount / killPeople / addPopulation\n/ forceResearch / unlockRecipe / notifyListener
@enduml
